"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You may have lost hold on your old self,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but somewhere deep down, you "
"kept calling for me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫하지만 ⟪k:3⟫그대가 비록 자기 자신을 잃었더라도……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫마음 한 구석에서 저를 꾸"
"준히 불러 주었기에……."

